   "description": "[Intro - Huge stadium crowd cheering, megaphone effect, slow heavy heartbeat kick, distant siren] TÜRKİYE! Biz Voleybol Ülkesiyiz! TÜRKİYE!\n\n[Pre-Drop - Rhythmic stadium claps building up, fast shakers, snare roll, intense hype, filter sweep opening]\n\n[SUDDEN SILENCE - one breath, crowd gasp]\n\n[Drop 1 - EXPLOSIVE Amapiano Log Drum, aggressive stadium bass, bouncy rhythm, crowd erupting] Zehra Güneş! Gizem Örge! Hande Baladın! Sinead Jack-Kısal! TÜRKİYE!\n\n[Bridge - Deep sub-bass rolls, hypnotic Amapiano groove, call and response with crowd] Elif Şahin! Cansu Özbay! İlkin Aydın! Saliha Şahin! TÜRKİYE!\n\n[Build-up - Pitch rising, crowd screaming, sirens, shakers accelerating, white noise riser] TÜRKİYE! TÜRKİYE! BİZ! VO! LEY! BOL!\n\n[BEAT CUT - TOTAL SILENCE]\n\n[Heavy Drop 2 - THE HARDEST DROP, filthy distorted log drum, glitchy and fast, double-time chops] Me-lis-sa Var-gas! Yap-rak Er-kek! Dilay Özdemir! Deniz Uyanık! TÜRKİYE!\n\n[Outro - Triumphant stadium chant fading into deep Amapiano beats, wide reverb, one name per bar] Berka Buse Özden! Eylül Akarçeşme! Defne Başyolcu!  TÜRKİYE!\n\n[Fade Out - Massive crowd roar, single final heavy log drum smash]",
